    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "E0C4B9E0FB4EC661",
      "text": "¿Ah, sí?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "E0C4B6E0FB4EC148",
      "text": "Entiendo",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_04a",
      "hash64": "70087DC730A13A08",
      "text": "Sí, el mero hecho de veros me llena a mí también\\nde vitalidad.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_04b",
      "hash64": "700880C730A13F21",
      "text": "Hm, que puedas entender mi punto de vista dice\\nmucho de ti. Demuestras una gran precocidad.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_tamer_01",
      "hash64": "0E3DFA9305CD80EC",
      "text": "Don Hesperio, ¿puedo hablar con usted un\\nmomento?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_05",
      "hash64": "268D87536FED8806",
      "text": "¿Qué estás haciendo tú aquí?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_06",
      "hash64": "268D86536FED8653",
      "text": "¿Acaso no he dejado bien claro que no quiero\\nque vengas a importunarme a la academia?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_b_tamer_02",
      "hash64": "0E3DFD9305CD8605",
      "text": "Así es, pero el bien de los nuestros tiene siempre\\nprioridad sobre cualquier otra consideración.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
